{
  "fixture_name": "paraphrase_heldout_v2",
  "purpose": "Generalization (NOT regression) benchmark for AskVera retrieval. Questions are worded UNLIKE source text to test semantic/paraphrase recall AND locale isolation across 6 markets. v2 replaces the Canada-only v1: every non-CA label is verified against that market's own PDF.",
