    "Distributed across 6 markets (CA, US, UK, DE, IT, NL) instead of Canada-only.",
    "All section labels VERIFIED against each market's own policy PDF via text extraction (see verification block).",
    "UK labelled at CHAPTER level (5/3/13/15) because UK uses a different subsection scheme (5.1/5.2, no 5.01/4.0X).",
    "Multilingual DE/IT/NL cases now carry market-correct governing sections, not borrowed Canada sub-letters."
  ],
